          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902301",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790230101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790230101": {
            "id": "790230101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "It's all my fault... I'm the reason he became like that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230102"
            ]
          },
          "790230102": {
            "id": "790230102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "No, I need to... bring the insignia back to him... I've got to find it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230103"
            ]
          },
          "790230103": {
            "id": "790230103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What's that Fatui guy muttering about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230104"
            ]
          },
          "790230104": {
            "id": "790230104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, what are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230105"
            ]
          },
          "790230105": {
            "id": "790230105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "The insignia... The insignia...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230108"
            ]
          },
          "790230108": {
            "id": "790230108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well... this does worry Paimon a little. Why is this Electrohammer Vanguard here? He isn't up to something bad, is he?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230109"
            ]
          },
          "790230109": {
            "id": "790230109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, how should we deal with this guy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230110"
            ]
          },
          "790230110": {
            "id": "790230110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Eh, only his charging attack is any threat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230111"
            ]
          },
          "790230111": {
            "id": "790230111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right, Electrohammer Vanguards are pretty dangerous when they sprint at full tilt... Wait, no, that's not what Paimon was talking about!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230112"
            ]
          },
          "790230112": {
            "id": "790230112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What Paimon meant is... Shouldn't we, y'know, wake him up and ask him what he's doing here...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230113"
            ]
          },
          "790230113": {
            "id": "790230113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It is quite the curious thing, indeed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230114"
            ]
          },
          "790230114": {
            "id": "790230114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah. It's not every day we have a Fatuus here muttering about some insignia or whatever... It seems like he's looking for something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230115"
            ]
          },
          "790230115": {
            "id": "790230115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This really isn't something that happens every day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230116"
            ]
          },
          "790230116": {
            "id": "790230116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, Paimon wonders what happened to leave him in this state...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230117"
            ]
          },
          "790230117": {
            "id": "790230117",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It must've been that machine's fault...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230118"
            ]
          },
          "790230118": {
            "id": "790230118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Right, the Fatui were also affected by the machine. But isn't there anything we can do to bring him back to his senses?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230119"
            ]
          },
          "790230119": {
            "id": "790230119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "I gotta find the insignia... That's the only way...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230120"
            ]
          },
          "790230120": {
            "id": "790230120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Seems like he's looking for some kind of insignia... Guess we need to find it for him, {NICKNAME}."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902302",
      "subQuestName": "Look for the insignia the Electrohammer Vanguard speaks of",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902303",
      "subQuestName": "Give the insignia to the Electrohammer Vanguard",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790230301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790230301": {
            "id": "790230301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, is the insignia we picked up on the beach the one he's muttering about? You know, the one that looks kinda shabby?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230302"
            ]
          },
          "790230302": {
            "id": "790230302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We might as well show it to him, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230303"
            ]
          },
          "790230303": {
            "id": "790230303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yeah, let's show him that insignia..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902313",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the Electrohammer Vanguard",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790231201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790231201": {
            "id": "790231201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "This is... Yeah, this is the one. I remember every scratch on this insignia. Huh, there's a new dent here. Why's that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231202"
            ]
          },
          "790231202": {
            "id": "790231202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "Oh right. Yakov threw it down back then, didn't he...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231203"
            ]
          },
          "790231203": {
            "id": "790231203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, so that's why that insignia was in such a weird spot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231204"
            ]
          },
          "790231204": {
            "id": "790231204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "I see. So you found it on the beach, eh... Heh, so it was found at last. Thank you both so much. I'm lucky to have met people as kind as you are.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231205"
            ]
          },
          "790231205": {
            "id": "790231205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "#...No, wait. You're {NICKNAME} and Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231206"
            ]
          },
          "790231206": {
            "id": "790231206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#That's right. That's {NICKNAME} to you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231207"
            ]
          },
          "790231207": {
            "id": "790231207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And Paimon's Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231208"
            ]
          },
          "790231208": {
            "id": "790231208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "I... I see. Now that I'm at your mercy, there's not much I can do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231209"
            ]
          },
          "790231209": {
            "id": "790231209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "My father once told me that \"if you have fallen into enemy hands, it is a better option to sacrifice yourself for the honor of your family.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231210"
            ]
          },
          "790231210": {
            "id": "790231210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? That sounds horrible...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231213"
            ]
          },
          "790231213": {
            "id": "790231213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "To be honest, though, we were just curious about why you're here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231214"
            ]
          },
          "790231214": {
            "id": "790231214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231215"
            ]
          },
          "790231215": {
            "id": "790231215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "My father once told me that \"giving information to the enemy is no different from betrayal. Our family raises no traitors!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231216"
            ]
          },
          "790231216": {
            "id": "790231216",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's way too harsh.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231217"
            ]
          },
          "790231217": {
            "id": "790231217",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Harsh indeed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231218"
            ]
          },
          "790231218": {
            "id": "790231218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "To be honest, it is truly shameful that I have fallen into your hands and even had to accept your help. That's what my father's teachings say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231219"
            ]
          },
          "790231219": {
            "id": "790231219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "To be honest, I'm so ashamed now that I want to cry!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231220"
            ]
          },
          "790231220": {
            "id": "790231220",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Okay, okay, we got it. Still, this isn't something to be proud of. You don't have to say it so loud.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231221"
            ]
          },
          "790231221": {
            "id": "790231221",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "Yet, my father also told me that \"When you receive a favor, you should return it.\" His words seem to contradict themselves in this situation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231222"
            ]
          },
          "790231222": {
            "id": "790231222",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "So I have decided to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231223"
            ]
          },
          "790231223": {
            "id": "790231223",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Have decided to do what?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231224"
            ]
          },
          "790231224": {
            "id": "790231224",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "Just do what I wish and tell you everything!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231225"
            ]
          },
          "790231225": {
            "id": "790231225",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, you sure became easygoing super quick!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231226"
            ]
          },
          "790231226": {
            "id": "790231226",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "My name is Chevka. I was carrying out signal testing work for the machine... Huh, my memory about it is a bit blurry. Anyway, I remember that we came all the way to this island...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231227"
            ]
          },
          "790231227": {
            "id": "790231227",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Oh, yeah, and I was with Yakov. We got into a fight, and that's why he threw the insignia away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231228"
            ]
          },
          "790231228": {
            "id": "790231228",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Then... I saw him walking into something really abnormal and disappear along with... whatever that abnormality was. Um, this doesn't mean that I'll never see him again, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231229"
            ]
          },
          "790231229": {
            "id": "790231229",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "That's what I hoped, anyway, and that's how I wound up looking for a way to reunite with him here. But then there was a buzzing sound, and my mind suddenly went blank. That's how I got into the state you saw me in earlier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231230"
            ]
          },
          "790231230": {
            "id": "790231230",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A thing that disappears with you once you walk into it? Is this some kind of Golden Apple Archipelago urban legend?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902305",
      "subQuestName": "Find a way to open the path that Yakov took",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790230501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790230501": {
            "id": "790230501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Huh, so there was an island like this there. How strange...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230502"
            ]
          },
          "790230502": {
            "id": "790230502",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "I don't remember this being here the last time when we were investigating earlier...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230503"
            ]
          },
          "790230503": {
            "id": "790230503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What is it, Chevka?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230504"
            ]
          },
          "790230504": {
            "id": "790230504",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Hmm... No, it's nothing, really.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230505"
            ]
          },
          "790230505": {
            "id": "790230505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes, it seems that Yakov definitely came to this island as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230506"
            ]
          },
          "790230506": {
            "id": "790230506",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "That's right. I've got to find Yakov. I've got to! Yakov—!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230507"
            ]
          },
          "790230507": {
            "id": "790230507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, hey, didn't we tell you to relax? Stop yelling so loudly!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230508"
            ]
          },
          "790230508": {
            "id": "790230508",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Oh. Um. Sorry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230509"
            ]
          },
          "790230509": {
            "id": "790230509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#There's no need to be so nervous. This place is very safe. Now, {NICKNAME}, let's go look for Yakov..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902306",
      "subQuestName": "Go and look for Yakov",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790230601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790230601": {
            "id": "790230601",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Phonograph",
            "text": "(The gramophone is playing songs that bring back warm memories of the past...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230602"
            ]
          },
          "790230602": {
            "id": "790230602",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Yakov",
            "text": "Oh... why...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230603"
            ]
          },
          "790230603": {
            "id": "790230603",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Yakov, Yakov, wake up! What happened to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230604"
            ]
          },
          "790230604": {
            "id": "790230604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You were just like him earlier, you know, muttering on about that insignia!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230605"
            ]
          },
          "790230605": {
            "id": "790230605",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Oh right, that insignia...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230606"
            ]
          },
          "790230606": {
            "id": "790230606",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Yakov, look! This is your insignia. You threw it away earlier, but it's been found...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230607"
            ]
          },
          "790230607": {
            "id": "790230607",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "It's an honor you earned together with your father, and now it's back in your hands... What do you say, Yakov? C'mon, man, wake up already...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230608"
            ]
          },
          "790230608": {
            "id": "790230608",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Yakov",
            "text": "Why... Why... Why did you leave me alone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230609"
            ]
          },
          "790230609": {
            "id": "790230609",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It doesn't seem to have helped...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230610"
            ]
          },
          "790230610": {
            "id": "790230610",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "If this won't bring him back to us, then what in the world does he want...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230611"
            ]
          },
          "790230611": {
            "id": "790230611",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You don't know what he's looking for? Aren't you guys teammates?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230612"
            ]
          },
          "790230612": {
            "id": "790230612",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "I... I always thought that honors were all that mattered to him. But no, I was wrong. That was just \"what I thought he valued\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230613"
            ]
          },
          "790230613": {
            "id": "790230613",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "He got this badge for completing an emergency mission together with his father, but his father never returned...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230614"
            ]
          },
          "790230614": {
            "id": "790230614",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "His mother passed away when he was born... So after losing his father, he was then all alone in the world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230615"
            ]
          },
          "790230615": {
            "id": "790230615",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "*sigh*... Though he's younger than me, he'd earned more honors than I. Maybe I was... I guess I was jealous of him. I didn't even know how to get along with him. The only example I could draw from...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230616"
            ]
          },
          "790230616": {
            "id": "790230616",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You got this from how your father treats you, didn't you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230617"
            ]
          },
          "790230617": {
            "id": "790230617",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Well, this is kind of embarrassing... But you guessed it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230618"
            ]
          },
          "790230618": {
            "id": "790230618",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y'know, it somehow doesn't surprise Paimon that the two of you have problems...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230619"
            ]
          },
          "790230619": {
            "id": "790230619",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Our base camp is on an island in the center of the sea. Yakov is still delirious, so I must send him there first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230620"
            ]
          },
          "790230620": {
            "id": "790230620",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "And... Oh yes. We... we were part of the team assigned by Researcher Persikov to conduct signal tests here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230621"
            ]
          },
          "790230621": {
            "id": "790230621",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "I've heard that one of the Lord Harbingers has learned in Sumeru that we can connect people's minds with the help of certain technologies, and that the impact of such technologies could cover an entire region...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230622"
            ]
          },
          "790230622": {
            "id": "790230622",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Things weren't looking all that promising, but Researcher Persikov decided to go ahead with these experiments anyway, and we were assigned to go out to sea and carry out signal tests in various places for this machine of ours...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230623"
            ]
          },
          "790230623": {
            "id": "790230623",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Speaking of which, I wonder how those experiments are going...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230624"
            ]
          },
          "790230624": {
            "id": "790230624",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, we are here, so the Fatui experiment...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230625"
            ]
          },
          "790230625": {
            "id": "790230625",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The experiment is kaput, duh.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230626"
            ]
          },
          "790230626": {
            "id": "790230626",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "That how it is? Haha, then I guess Researcher Persikov's gonna have to pay that toll.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230627"
            ]
          },
          "790230627": {
            "id": "790230627",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "That's all I know. I made arrangements with <color=#00E1FFFF>the other team members</color> that we'd go back to our base camp in the center of the sea once we finished testing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230628"
            ]
          },
          "790230628": {
            "id": "790230628",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "They should be somewhere on <color=#00E1FFFF>the two islands in the north</color>... According to our mission progress, they're probably on the <color=#00E1FFFF>northwestern island</color>...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230629"
            ]
          },
          "790230629": {
            "id": "790230629",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "*sigh*... Agafya would be crazy mad at me if she saw Yakov like this... But I've got to bring Yakov back no matter what!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902307",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Chevka",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902308",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Yakov",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790230801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790230801": {
            "id": "790230801",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "It's all my fault... I'm the reason he became like that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230802"
            ]
          },
          "790230802": {
            "id": "790230802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "No, I need to... bring the insignia back to him... I've got to find it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230803"
            ]
          },
          "790230803": {
            "id": "790230803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230804"
            ]
          },
          "790230804": {
            "id": "790230804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "The insignia... The insignia...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230805"
            ]
          },
          "790230805": {
            "id": "790230805",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gah, he's completely ignoring us...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230806"
            ]
          },
          "790230806": {
            "id": "790230806",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A little louder, Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230807"
            ]
          },
          "790230807": {
            "id": "790230807",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's pretty clear that he can't hear us. Speaking louder won't help at all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230808"
            ]
          },
          "790230808": {
            "id": "790230808",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He acts exactly like Agafya earlier, remember? She came to reason as soon as we gave her the pocket watch with a picture.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230809"
            ]
          },
          "790230809": {
            "id": "790230809",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe there is also something that can wake the Electrohammer Vanguard from the impact of the machine?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790230810"
            ]
          },
          "790230810": {
            "id": "790230810",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Seems like he's looking for some kind of insignia... Guess we need to find it for him, {NICKNAME}."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902309",
      "subQuestName": "Try to wake Yakov up",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790232001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790232001": {
            "id": "790232001",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Phonograph",
            "text": "(The gramophone is playing songs that bring back warm memories of the past...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232002"
            ]
          },
          "790232002": {
            "id": "790232002",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Yakov",
            "text": "Oh... why...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232003"
            ]
          },
          "790232003": {
            "id": "790232003",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Yakov, Yakov, wake up! What happened to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232004"
            ]
          },
          "790232004": {
            "id": "790232004",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You were just like him earlier, you know, muttering on about that insignia!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232005"
            ]
          },
          "790232005": {
            "id": "790232005",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Oh right, that insignia...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232006"
            ]
          },
          "790232006": {
            "id": "790232006",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Yakov, look! This is your insignia. You threw it away earlier, but it's been found...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232007"
            ]
          },
          "790232007": {
            "id": "790232007",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "It's an honor you earned together with your father, and now it's back in your hands... What do you say, Yakov? C'mon, man, wake up already...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232030"
            ]
          },
          "790232030": {
            "id": "790232030",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Yakov",
            "text": "Why... Why... Why did you leave me alone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232008"
            ]
          },
          "790232008": {
            "id": "790232008",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It doesn't seem to have helped...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232009"
            ]
          },
          "790232009": {
            "id": "790232009",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "If this won't bring him back to us, then what in the world does he want...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232010"
            ]
          },
          "790232010": {
            "id": "790232010",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You don't know what he's looking for? Aren't you guys teammates?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232011"
            ]
          },
          "790232011": {
            "id": "790232011",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "I... I always thought that honors were all that mattered to him. But no, I was wrong. That was just \"what I thought he valued\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232012"
            ]
          },
          "790232012": {
            "id": "790232012",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "He got this badge for completing an emergency mission together with his father, but his father never returned...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232013"
            ]
          },
          "790232013": {
            "id": "790232013",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "His mother passed away when he was born... So after losing his father, he was then all alone in the world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232014"
            ]
          },
          "790232014": {
            "id": "790232014",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "*sigh*... Though he's younger than me, he'd earned more honors than I. Maybe I was... I guess I was jealous of him. I didn't even know how to get along with him. The only example I could draw from...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232015"
            ]
          },
          "790232015": {
            "id": "790232015",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You got this from how your father treats you, didn't you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232016"
            ]
          },
          "790232016": {
            "id": "790232016",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Well, this is kind of embarrassing... But you guessed it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232017"
            ]
          },
          "790232017": {
            "id": "790232017",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y'know, it somehow doesn't surprise Paimon that the two of you have problems...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232018"
            ]
          },
          "790232018": {
            "id": "790232018",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Our base camp is on an island in the center of the sea. Yakov is still delirious, so I must send him there first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232019"
            ]
          },
          "790232019": {
            "id": "790232019",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "And... Oh yes. We... we were part of the team assigned by Researcher Persikov to conduct signal tests here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232020"
            ]
          },
          "790232020": {
            "id": "790232020",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "I've heard that one of the Lord Harbingers has learned in Sumeru that we can connect people's minds with the help of certain technologies, and that the impact of such technologies could cover an entire region...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232021"
            ]
          },
          "790232021": {
            "id": "790232021",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Things weren't looking all that promising, but Researcher Persikov decided to go ahead with these experiments anyway, and we were assigned to go out to sea and carry out signal tests in various places for this machine of ours...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232022"
            ]
          },
          "790232022": {
            "id": "790232022",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Speaking of which, I wonder how those experiments are going...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232023"
            ]
          },
          "790232023": {
            "id": "790232023",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, we are here, so the Fatui experiment...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232024"
            ]
          },
          "790232024": {
            "id": "790232024",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The experiment is kaput, duh.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232025"
            ]
          },
          "790232025": {
            "id": "790232025",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "That how it is? Haha, then I guess Researcher Persikov's gonna have to pay that toll.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232026"
            ]
          },
          "790232026": {
            "id": "790232026",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "That's all I know. I made arrangements with the other team members that we'd go back to our base camp in the center of the sea once we finished testing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232027"
            ]
          },
          "790232027": {
            "id": "790232027",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, you must be referring to the Fatui we met earlier!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232028"
            ]
          },
          "790232028": {
            "id": "790232028",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Oh, so you've met them, have you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232029"
            ]
          },
          "790232029": {
            "id": "790232029",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "*sigh*... Agafya would be crazy mad at me if she saw Yakov like this... But I've got to bring Yakov back no matter what!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902311",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790231101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790231101": {
            "id": "790231101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Electrohammer Vanguard",
            "text": "I gotta find the insignia... That's the only way...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231102"
            ]
          },
          "790231102": {
            "id": "790231102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Let's talk to him after we find the insignia...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902312",
      "subQuestName": "Look for traces of the other group's members",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902315",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790231501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790231501": {
            "id": "790231501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Have you found a way to open the device? I mean, I'm not rushing you or anything, but... Why, is there something wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231503",
              "790231505"
            ]
          },
          "790231503": {
            "id": "790231503",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "We came here to complete our glorious mission, of course. But as for the details... I'll tell you more after we find Yakov..."
          },
          "790231505": {
            "id": "790231505",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "You mean you think it's strange that I'm so familiar with an insignia that is not even mine...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231506"
            ]
          },
          "790231506": {
            "id": "790231506",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Well, that badge belongs to Yakov. He went on this mission once together with his father, but he came back alone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790231507"
            ]
          },
          "790231507": {
            "id": "790231507",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "He got that insignia after that mission... I envied the honor he won so much that I wound up borrowing it many times. Just to have a look."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902321",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790232101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790232101": {
            "id": "790232101",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "#*sigh*, what am I gonna do about Yakov... What, is there anything else, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232103",
              "790232106"
            ]
          },
          "790232103": {
            "id": "790232103",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Why... I joined the Fatui?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232104"
            ]
          },
          "790232104": {
            "id": "790232104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "Well, I did it to help realize the long-cherished wish of Her Royal Highness the Tsaritsa... and to bring more honor to my family. I was raised to fight for the Tsaritsa."
          },
          "790232106": {
            "id": "790232106",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "*sigh* It seems that Yakov is still delirious..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902322",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790232201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790232201": {
            "id": "790232201",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Yakov",
            "text": "Why... Why did you leave me alone, Father... Why...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232202"
            ]
          },
          "790232202": {
            "id": "790232202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(He still doesn't seem to be in his right mind...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7902327",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "790232701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "790232701": {
            "id": "790232701",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "What happened back there? I... don't really understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "790232702"
            ]
          },
          "790232702": {
            "id": "790232702",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Chevka",
            "text": "How did it go? Have you found Yakov?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}